#: scenario3:scenario3_408A4EAD_D6DF_42EE_B1F0_59E5E31418C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d7dd65b84bee9bbdb661d4dc7526a099b527ef206fed2359f67c3b2f903fec63
