#: scenario3:scenario3_17D4883B_50CA_4CDD_BC6E_79BE38110923
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 226fff4c9b29b7a45cc2c45e750423b679ec5df55ed39c80396d3063c68910fc
